div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-302702 wxdxj.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/67/Spine_static-302702_wxdxj.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"159\" height=\"222\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"159\" data-file-height=\"222\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3027\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BF%E7%94%B5%E5%B0%8F%E5%A7%90\" title=\"无线电小姐\"><img alt=\"Bgequip2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/100px-Bgequip2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/150px-Bgequip2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/200px-Bgequip2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BF%E7%94%B5%E5%B0%8F%E5%A7%90\" title=\"无线电小姐\"><img alt=\"无线电小姐\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BF%E7%94%B5%E5%B0%8F%E5%A7%90\" title=\"无线电小姐\">无线电小姐</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.0</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>橄榄枝战线</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302702</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">哔哔哔——<br />无线电小姐还不怎么习惯这套新的涂装，正如同她不怎么喜欢现在的新闻。<br />每一天都有新的战场被开辟，枪械在尖啸，炮火在轰鸣，战士的鲜血流成了一条暗河。但她必须去做这件事，还有无数的情报等待着经由她播出。这些情报每一条都至关重要，足以成为改变战局的关键节点。<br />这是一场必须赢下的战争，只有这样，所有人才能迎来明天。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302702\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/29/Belonging-302704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">六边环形天线<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Hexagon Loop Antenna</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>“既符合时代风格，又增加了能够接收的频段，就算是最机密的3027……”<br />正当受访者滔滔不绝地介绍着天线构造之时，一档突如其来的劣质广播节目打断了她的骄傲。<br />“哦哦！您正在收听的是……《基金会之声》。由热心观众发来信件，希望探讨基金会楼梯阶梯数量与食堂饭菜质量的关系……”<br />但愿这不是因为受访者差点泄露机密。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/09/Belonging-302705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">复古壳体设计图<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Retro Case Design</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在与数名当前时代的优秀同胞交谈后，由受访者主导并创作的崭新外壳设计图。其设计顺应了当前时代的风潮，在兼具实用性与时髦感的同时，也保留了百日菊的位置。<br />“换新装也是我被赋予的重大使命之一。”受访者如是说。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b3/Belonging-302706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">一叠通讯记录<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Communication Records</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者的主要工作是梳理巨量的战时信息，她的心情也一直被复杂无常的局势左右。<br />尽管这些信息时常会使受访者觉得和平遥遥无期，但她仍期待着自己能够接收到宣告和平的讯号并转换成电磁波与人们欢呼。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 战地生命线1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 战地生命线2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%88%98%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">战地生命线 <small style=\"color: grey\">Lifeline of the Battlefield</small></span></span>"}}